     "I can hear your breathing from here.",
     "The storm is coming!",
     "Steady hands, focus."
    ]
   },
   "win": {
    "ar": "العاصفة انتهت... وأنت الفائز.",
    "en": "The storm is over... you win.",
    "fr": "La tempête est finie... tu gagnes."
